<title>USA: Loews says Lorillard boards OK tabacco deal.</title>
<headline>Loews says Lorillard boards OK tabacco deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loews Corp said Thursday the boards of its Lorilland Inc and Lorilland Tabacco Co units have approved the June 20 proposed tabacco settlement.</p>
<p>The company said its board of directors has also voted to support the proposal.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
